{icon:"📱",t:["Getting Started with Your Smartphone","अपने स्मार्टफ़ोन की शुरुआत","স্মার্টফোনের সঙ্গে পরিচয়"],d:["Learn phone parts, screen controls and safe charging.","फ़ोन के हिस्से, स्क्रीन नियंत्रण और सुरक्षित चार्जिंग सीखें।","ফোনের অংশ, স্ক্রিন নিয়ন্ত্রণ ও নিরাপদ চার্জিং শিখুন।"],l:[
["Meet your smartphone","Recognise the screen, side buttons, camera, speaker and charging port.","Look at the large touchscreen. Find the side buttons, usually for power and volume. Find the charging port and camera openings. Designs differ by model.","Point to the screen, buttons and charging port.","Never insert metal objects into ports."],
["Power, lock and unlock","Wake the screen and lock it safely.","If the phone is off, hold the power button. To wake it, briefly press power or tap the screen if supported. Unlock with your own PIN, pattern or fingerprint. Briefly press power to lock.","Practise waking and locking the phone twice.","Never share your unlock PIN with callers or strangers."],
["Home screen, sound and brightness","Find apps and adjust the display.","The home screen shows app icons. Swipe gently to see apps or notifications. Use side buttons for volume. Swipe down from the top to find Quick Settings and brightness, if available.","Find Phone, Camera and Settings; adjust brightness, then set it comfortably.","Change one setting at a time. Ask for help if the screen looks unfamiliar."],
["Charge safely","Use compatible charging equipment.","Use a compatible charger and undamaged cable. Check for cracks or fraying. Connect gently and charge on a dry, hard surface. Hold the plug—not the cable—when disconnecting.","Inspect your charger and cable without using damaged equipment.","Keep chargers away from water, bedding and extreme heat."]
],q:[["Which part responds to touch?",["Speaker","Touchscreen","Charging port"],1,"The touchscreen displays information and responds to your touch."],["How do you usually lock the screen?",["Briefly press power","Share your PIN","Remove the SIM"],0,"A brief press of the power button commonly locks the screen."],["Which charger is safest?",["Damaged cable","Compatible undamaged charger","Metal wire"],1,"Use compatible equipment in good condition."]]},
{icon:"📞",t:["Calls and Contacts","कॉल और कॉन्टैक्ट","কল ও কনট্যাক্ট"],d:["Make calls, answer calls and save trusted numbers.","कॉल करें, कॉल उठाएँ और भरोसेमंद नंबर सेव करें।","কল করুন, কল ধরুন ও পরিচিত নম্বর সংরক্ষণ করুন।"],l:[
["Make a call","Call a known person from Phone or Contacts.","Open Phone. Use the keypad or choose a saved contact. Check the number or name, tap Call, then tap the red end-call button when finished.","Call a trusted person only after checking the number.","Do not return suspicious missed calls asking for money or codes."],
["Answer and end calls","Recognise call controls.","When a call arrives, check the displayed number or name. Use the on-screen answer control. Speak clearly and tap the red end-call control to finish.","Ask a trusted person to call so you can practise answering.","Caller ID can be faked; do not trust a caller based only on the displayed name."],
["Save a contact","Save and find a trusted phone number.","Open Contacts and tap Add or +. Enter the person's name and verify their number. Tap Save. Use Search to find the contact later.","Save one trusted contact and double-check its number.","Do not assume a stranger is a bank or government official without verification."]
],q:[["What should you check before calling?",["Name or number","Wallpaper","Battery brand"],0,"Check the contact or number to avoid calling the wrong person."],["Which control usually ends a call?",["Green answer","Red end-call","Brightness"],1,"The red handset control usually ends the call."],["A caller asks for your OTP. What should you do?",["Share it","Refuse to share it","Send a screenshot"],1,"Never share OTPs, PINs or passwords with callers."]]},
{icon:"💬",t:["SMS, WhatsApp and Messaging","SMS, WhatsApp और संदेश","SMS, WhatsApp ও মেসেজ"],d:["Send messages, voice notes, photos and video calls safely.","मैसेज, वॉइस नोट, फ़ोटो और वीडियो कॉल सुरक्षित रूप से इस्तेमाल करें।","নিরাপদে মেসেজ, ভয়েস নোট, ছবি ও ভিডিও কল ব্যবহার করুন।"],l:[
["Send an SMS","Write and send a simple text message.","Open Messages. Select a conversation or New message. Choose a known contact or carefully enter the number. Type a short message, check it, then tap Send.","Send a greeting to a trusted contact.","Unexpected urgent links, threats or prize messages may be scams."],
["WhatsApp chats and voice notes","Send text or a short voice message.","Open WhatsApp and select a trusted chat. Type in the message box and tap Send. To record a voice note, press and hold the microphone icon; the interface may vary. Check the recipient first.","Send a greeting or practise locating the microphone icon.","Check the chat before sending private photos or documents."],
["Media and video calls","Find attachment and video-call controls.","In a trusted chat, locate the attachment or camera icon. Check the recipient before sharing. During a video call, use microphone and camera controls to mute or turn video off. Group messages may be seen by all members.","Locate the attachment and video-call icons without sending anything.","Ask permission before sharing others' photos. Verify claims before forwarding them."]
],q:[["What should you do with a suspicious link?",["Tap quickly","Avoid opening it if unsure","Forward it to everyone"],1,"Suspicious links may lead to scams or harmful pages."],["Before sending a photo, check…",["Photo and recipient","Battery","Nothing"],0,"Check the selected photo and intended recipient."],["Who may see a group message?",["Only you","Group members","Nobody"],1,"Members of the group may be able to see it."]]},
{icon:"🌐",t:["Internet and Searching","इंटरनेट और खोज","ইন্টারনেট ও সার্চ"],d:["Connect to the internet and search more safely.","इंटरनेट से जुड़ें और सुरक्षित तरीके से जानकारी खोजें।","ইন্টারনেটে যুক্ত হন ও নিরাপদে তথ্য খুঁজুন।"],l:[
["Wi-Fi and mobile data","Understand common internet connections.","Swipe down for Quick Settings. Tap Wi-Fi and select a network you are allowed to use. For mobile data, find Mobile data in Quick Settings or Settings. Symbols vary by phone.","Check whether Wi-Fi is connected; do not join unknown networks just because they are free.","Public Wi-Fi may not be private. Avoid sensitive activity on unknown networks."],
["Search the web","Find information with a browser.","Open a browser. Tap the address or search bar and type a clear question. Review results and check the source and date before trusting information.","Search for a harmless topic such as your town's weather.","The first result may be an advertisement or misleading page."],
["Recognise safer websites","Check website addresses and avoid suspicious pop-ups.","Read the address carefully for misspellings. HTTPS encrypts a connection but does not prove a site is honest. For banking or government services, use the official app or known address.","Open a familiar trusted site and locate its address bar.","Never enter passwords, card details or OTPs after an unexpected link."]
],q:[["Does HTTPS prove a website is genuine?",["Always","No, it only indicates an encrypted connection","It means it is a bank"],1,"Scam sites can also use HTTPS."],["An unfamiliar pop-up asks you to install an app. You should…",["Install it","Close or ignore it","Enter your password"],1,"Use official app stores, not unsolicited pop-ups."],["How should you judge a search result?",["Trust the first result","Check source and date","Believe every ad"],1,"Check the publisher, date and supporting evidence."]]},
{icon:"📸",t:["Camera, Photos and Gallery","कैमरा, फ़ोटो और गैलरी","ক্যামেরা, ছবি ও গ্যালারি"],d:["Take photos, find them and share media carefully.","फ़ोटो लें, उन्हें खोजें और सावधानी से साझा करें।","ছবি তুলুন, খুঁজুন ও সাবধানে শেয়ার করুন।"],l:[
["Take a photo","Use the camera to capture a picture.","Open Camera. Choose Photo mode if needed. Hold the phone steady, frame the subject and tap the round shutter button.","Take a picture of an object at home.","Avoid photographing private documents or people without permission."],
["Find photos and videos","Open the Gallery or Photos app.","Open Gallery or Photos. Tap a thumbnail to view it. Swipe between pictures if supported. Use Albums or Collections to browse groups.","Find and open the photo you just took.","Your gallery may contain private pictures; be careful when showing it."],
["Share or delete media","Check carefully before sharing or deleting.","Open a photo and verify it is the right one. Tap Share and choose a trusted app and recipient. Use the bin only after checking the selected item. Look in Trash if you delete by mistake.","Open the Share menu, then cancel without sending anything.","Shared images can be copied or forwarded. Share only what you are comfortable sharing."]
],q:[["Before sharing a photo, check…",["Photo and recipient","First contact only","Nothing"],0,"Confirm the photo and recipient before sending."],["Where might a deleted photo temporarily remain?",["Trash or Recently Deleted","Keypad","Wi-Fi"],0,"Some apps keep deleted items temporarily, but recovery is not guaranteed."],["What does the shutter button do?",["Take a photo","Change Wi-Fi","Lock phone"],0,"The shutter button captures a picture."]]},
{icon:"🧩",t:["Apps and Phone Settings","ऐप और फ़ोन सेटिंग्स","অ্যাপ ও ফোনের সেটিংস"],d:["Open apps, update safely and adjust useful settings.","ऐप खोलें, सुरक्षित अपडेट करें और उपयोगी सेटिंग्स बदलें।","অ্যাপ খুলুন, নিরাপদে আপডেট করুন ও দরকারি সেটিংস বদলান।"],l:[
["Open and switch apps","Find and open installed apps.","Tap an app icon on the home screen or app list. Use Home to return. If available, use Recent apps to switch between open apps.","Open Settings, return home, then open Camera.","Do not tap unknown warnings claiming your phone is infected."],
["Install and update apps","Use the official app store.","Open the official store, such as Google Play Store. Search the exact app and check its publisher. Review permissions. Use the store's Update option when available.","View an app's publisher in the official store without installing anything.","Avoid APK files from strangers and pop-ups asking for payment to remove a fake virus."],
["Useful settings","Find display, sound, Wi-Fi and accessibility settings.","Open Settings using the gear icon. Use Settings search if needed. Find Display, Sound, Wi-Fi or Accessibility. Change one setting and check the result.","Find text-size or magnification settings; change them only if useful.","Avoid reset, developer and security settings unless you understand their effects."]
],q:[["Where should you normally install apps?",["Random message link","Official app store","Pop-up ad"],1,"Official app stores are a safer way to find apps."],["How should you change settings?",["Many at once","One at a time","Tap everything"],1,"One change at a time makes it easier to undo unwanted changes."],["An app asks for unrelated permissions. You should…",["Approve all","Pause and review","Share your password"],1,"Review whether each permission is needed."]]},
{icon:"💳",t:["Digital Payments and UPI","डिजिटल भुगतान और UPI","ডিজিটাল পেমেন্ট ও UPI"],d:["Understand UPI safety. Never use real money just to practise.","UPI सुरक्षा समझें। अभ्यास के लिए असली पैसे का उपयोग न करें।","UPI নিরাপত্তা বুঝুন। অনুশীলনের জন্য আসল টাকা ব্যবহার করবেন না।"],l:[
["Understand UPI","Know the difference between paying and receiving money.","UPI apps transfer money between linked bank accounts. Before paying, verify the receiver and amount. A UPI PIN authorises a payment. You do not need to enter your PIN or share an OTP to receive money.","If you have a payment app, review its home screen without starting a transaction.","Never disclose your UPI PIN, OTP, card PIN or screen-lock PIN."],
["Requests and QR codes","Avoid accidental or fraudulent payments.","Before approval, check the receiver name and amount. Scanning a QR or approving a collect request may lead to a payment. Do not approve a request to receive a refund or prize. Cancel and verify if unsure.","Identify the amount and receiver fields without making a payment.","A UPI PIN authorises a payment; it is not required just to receive money."],
["If a payment seems wrong","Know the first steps after suspected fraud.","Do not approve more requests or share codes. Keep the transaction ID, time and amount private. Contact your bank through its official app or verified channel. In India, report suspected cyber financial fraud promptly via 1930 and the official cybercrime portal.","Remember: pause, verify, never share your PIN or OTP.","Beware of people promising to recover money for an upfront fee."]
],q:[["Do you need a UPI PIN to receive money?",["Yes","No","Only at night"],1,"A UPI PIN authorises payments; it is not needed to receive money."],["Before approving a payment, check…",["Receiver and amount","Wallpaper","Nothing"],0,"Always verify the recipient and amount."],["Someone asks for an OTP to give a refund. You should…",["Share it","Refuse and verify independently","Send a bank screenshot"],1,"Never disclose OTPs to strangers."]]},
{icon:"🛡️",t:["Privacy, Scams and Security","गोपनीयता, धोखाधड़ी और सुरक्षा","গোপনীয়তা, প্রতারণা ও নিরাপত্তা"],d:["Protect accounts, spot scams and respond safely.","खातों की सुरक्षा करें, धोखाधड़ी पहचानें और सुरक्षित कदम उठाएँ।","অ্যাকাউন্ট সুরক্ষিত রাখুন, প্রতারণা চিনুন ও নিরাপদ পদক্ষেপ নিন।"],l:[
["Safer passwords and screen locks","Protect your phone and accounts.","Use a screen lock and unique strong passwords for important accounts. Avoid birthdays and simple sequences. Use two-step verification when available. Never keep passwords visible to strangers.","Check whether a screen lock is enabled without revealing your code.","Legitimate support staff do not need your password or OTP."],
["Spot common scams","Recognise pressure, impersonation and suspicious requests.","Pause if a caller creates panic, threatens arrest or promises a prize. Never share OTPs, PINs or passwords. Do not install remote-access apps because a stranger asks. Verify claims using an official channel.","Practise saying: “I will verify this independently and call back using an official number.”","Scammers may impersonate relatives, police, banks or customer support."],
["Block, report and recover","Take safe steps after suspicious messages or account compromise.","Do not reply, click links or send money. Use Block and Report in the app. If you shared a password, change it through the official service and secure reused passwords. If money may be stolen in India, contact your bank and report via 1930/official cybercrime channels.","Find Block or Report in a messaging app without blocking a real contact.","Never pay an unknown person who promises recovery for an upfront fee."]
],q:[["A caller claiming to be from your bank asks for an OTP. You should…",["Share it","Refuse and contact the bank officially","Text it"],1,"Never share OTPs with callers."],["Which is a warning sign of a scam?",["Pressure to act immediately","Taking time to check","Using an official app"],0,"Scammers create urgency to stop you thinking."],["After entering a password on a suspicious site, you should…",["Ignore it","Change it through the official service","Post it publicly"],1,"Change compromised passwords and protect any account where you reused them."]]}
